(property "Description" "Functional pass-through assembly; matching H_*/C_* pins are intended connected pairwise inside cable. No asserted PCB pad numbers. | module | All host-to-card 3.3V conductors isolated on card side and replaced by LIME3V3; grounds/sidebands/PCIe pairs preserved. Connector variant and exact modification points require ADT-Link confirmation. No Y connection between switched and unswitched3.3V.; Matching host/card signal contacts share the same canonical E5_PCIE_* nets to model verified intended pass-through without claiming an active buffer. Physical exact adapter pinout and cut locations remain gated." (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
