(property "Description" "Functional USB3 device/cable interface; no fabricated USB-C contact mapping. | module | Switch only VBUS in a short controlled assembly; preserve all four SuperSpeed conductors, USB2 pair, GND and screen. Do not splice into long loose wires. EN_T7 low after sync/unmount; enumeration not equal RF quiet, test authorized=0 versus power-off.; Q6A source remains its own J5/U35 VBUS. LAB5 fallback is unpopulated, no source ORing jumper fitted." (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
