(text "T7 VBUS rail capacity and modified cable SuperSpeed signal integrity untested.\nВорота (стенд): With a real T7 prove J5 load <1.5 A expected operating budget, VCC_5V_PERI <=14 W, 5000M/UAS,\nno USB resets, fio, hot-corner TJ <=105 C for 1.5 A. Re-evaluate rail/switch/cable if failed." (at 13.97 38.93 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 5f928cbb-dbf1-5abc-9554-a00222fe8ad8))
